# World model

**Thesis:** So-that says who benefits next. World says what must be true for that person to see the shared object. Persona UI must follow admission — never paint gates as decision chrome.

Full law: `docs/build-foundation/09-world-model.md`  
Worked V1: `docs/register/WORLD.md`  
Machine twin: `apps/tally/src/app/register/world/campaignWorld.ts`

## Do

- Before persona click-through or plant, check persona sit + Campaign admission matrix
- Use `admits(persona, state)` / `workerAvailableAdmits` when deciding what appears in a view
- Show only **decision** labels for that persona (e.g. Worker: `unclaimed`)
- Keep **Never see** lists honest when adding screens

## Don't

- Advertise an admission gate on the row (e.g. Worker Available showing `funded`)
- Put unfunded / unlaunched campaigns in the Worker queue
- Fold other personas' screens into Operator (or any) click-through
- Expand world into an encyclopedia — cohesive ecosystem only
